  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Ebola virus disease containment efforts in Uganda through food assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this WFP is to complement the already planned efforts to provide immediate food and assistance to 7,500 people as part of Ebola virus disease containment efforts in category one districts of Uganda.  The WFP&#x2019;s food assistance will be undertaken in the context of institutional feeding and dry food rations in close coordination with WHO and UNICEF. This WFP project assists 7,500 people, including 1,763 women, 1,951 men, 3,488 children, and including 598 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
